ode_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc3ODA=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/platform:macos","name":"platform:macos","color":"e4e4e4","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098255,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyNTU=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:platforms","name":"topic:platforms","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":7,"created_at":"2025-07-20T15:39:14Z","updated_at":"2025-07-23T18:33:31Z","closed_at":"2025-07-23T18:14:28Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nThis seems to happen with any Godot version.\nI tested Godot 3.6.1 Stable Mono, Godot 4.4.1 Stable Mono, and Godot 4.5 beta 3 Mono\n\n### System information\n\nMacOS 15.5\n\n### Issue description\n\nWhen having multiple Godot versions on macOS, macOS’s Launchpad only shows the latest version of Godot.\n\n<img src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/6e8f7c9b-ba72-45cd-839d-e461bb09d383\" width=\"400\"/>\n\n<img src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/87056adf-5128-4f03-922d-2718488e7164\" width=\"350\"/>\n\n\nThis might be because each Godot version has the same **CFBundleIdentifier** (found in the app's Info.plist file) making MacOS only show the latest Godot version.\nI tried to change the **CFBundleIdentifier** myself but it didn't fix anything so it might be something else.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n- Have Multiple Godot Versions in the Application folder (I additionally put them into a file called Godots. e.g. /Applications/Godots/Godot_4.4.app) (I also tested them just being in the Application folder)\n- Open Launchpad and find the one Godot app\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nN/A","closed_by":{"login":"OrderX8","id":196700478,"node_id":"U_kgDOC7lpPg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/196700478?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/OrderX8","html_url":"https://github.com/OrderX8","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OrderX8/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OrderX8/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OrderX8/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OrderX8/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OrderX8/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OrderX8/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OrderX8/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OrderX8/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OrderX8/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108801/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108801/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"not_planned","pinned_comment":null}